(7534659, 1205108, 173844, '<td valign="top">What beautiful distortions here.  Imagine an entire cityscape done up this way!  Crisply delineated and creamily colored.  I want to really see a sky like this, swirling and burgeoning and lined with deep blue.  The composition is very pleasing.  Excellent image.<br/>One of two personal favorites for this challenge.</td>', 'What beautiful distortions here.  Imagine an entire cityscape done up this way!  Crisply delineated and creamily colored.  I want to really see a sky like this, swirling and burgeoning and lined with deep blue.  The composition is very pleasing.  Excellent image.One of two personal favorites for this challenge.', '2017-09-12 14:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534662, 1205190, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, even thrilling.  This reflection world is alluring and just out of reach.  Nice palette of light and dark colors.  The lower bodies of the actual people are well-integrated into the picture, not intrusive but plainly there.  I love how the sky is flattened, looking like a drop-in ceiling.<br/>One of two personal favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image, even thrilling.  This reflection world is alluring and just out of reach.  Nice palette of light and dark colors.  The lower bodies of the actual people are well-integrated into the picture, not intrusive but plainly there.  I love how the sky is flattened, looking like a drop-in ceiling.One of two personal favorites in this challenge.', '2017-09-12 14:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534666, 1205009, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great extreme transformation of this airplane.  It''s utterly mutated, yet apparently still flying.  We are introduced into a bizarre new universe.  The airplane''s colors work perfectly with the sky, and the window dividers seem to be a grid upon which this metamorphosis is plotted.  Fascinating and engaging.</td>', 'Great extreme transformation of this airplane.  It''s utterly mutated, yet apparently still flying.  We are introduced into a bizarre new universe.  The airplane''s colors work perfectly with the sky, and the window dividers seem to be a grid upon which this metamorphosis is plotted.  Fascinating and engaging.', '2017-09-12 14:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534667, 1205191, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  The cozy couple, shimmering under blue-green stripes, is judiciously placed to view this perplexing, to me, work of art.  There''s a intriguing softness throughout, a pleasant remove.  Quite enjoyable.</td>', 'Lovely image.  The cozy couple, shimmering under blue-green stripes, is judiciously placed to view this perplexing, to me, work of art.  There''s a intriguing softness throughout, a pleasant remove.  Quite enjoyable.', '2017-09-12 15:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534669, 1205193, 173844, '<td valign="top">Pretty image.  Nice glow on the mountainsides.</td>', 'Pretty image.  Nice glow on the mountainsides.', '2017-09-12 15:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534671, 1205189, 173844, '<td valign="top">In your face, as those of great wealth often are, yet lovingly detailed with a tracery of trees.  I like the juxtaposition and the crispness of lines and details.  Classy, aside from being a Royce.</td>', 'In your face, as those of great wealth often are, yet lovingly detailed with a tracery of trees.  I like the juxtaposition and the crispness of lines and details.  Classy, aside from being a Royce.', '2017-09-12 15:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534673, 1205087, 173844, '<td valign="top">Unlike so many amusement parks, this image is delicate, almost demure.  The wistful reflection is very nicely framed in the puddle, the plain expanse of ground given plenty of room to establish itself.  The white vignette beautifully adds to the overall tenor of the photograph.  The tiny bird in the upper right corner is the final grace note.  Terrific.</td>', 'Unlike so many amusement parks, this image is delicate, almost demure.  The wistful reflection is very nicely framed in the puddle, the plain expanse of ground given plenty of room to establish itself.  The white vignette beautifully adds to the overall tenor of the photograph.  The tiny bird in the upper right corner is the final grace note.  Terrific.', '2017-09-12 15:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534674, 1205013, 173844, '<td valign="top">Gaudy kaleidoscope of color and flash, kind of like a fire opal.  However disorganized it may appear, it works well as an entirety.  The red glass on the sides is like a curtain opening upon a phantasmagoria.  Plenty of good cheer and spirit.</td>', 'Gaudy kaleidoscope of color and flash, kind of like a fire opal.  However disorganized it may appear, it works well as an entirety.  The red glass on the sides is like a curtain opening upon a phantasmagoria.  Plenty of good cheer and spirit.', '2017-09-12 15:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534675, 1205187, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting, unusual image.  The black and white framework and bounding rabbits are set off in lovely fashion by likewise interesting and unusual soft colors above the sign, as well as the bolder red edging.  Delightful.</td>', 'Interesting, unusual image.  The black and white framework and bounding rabbits are set off in lovely fashion by likewise interesting and unusual soft colors above the sign, as well as the bolder red edging.  Delightful.', '2017-09-12 15:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534676, 1204688, 173844, '<td valign="top">Impressively immense, and so is the reflected sky.  I especially like how the clouds lap upon the foreground shore.</td>', 'Impressively immense, and so is the reflected sky.  I especially like how the clouds lap upon the foreground shore.', '2017-09-12 15:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534677, 1204976, 173844, '<td valign="top">Classic glass skyscrapers and reflected sky, but done so very well.  The transition is almost seamless, which heightens the illusion.  The composition is simple and elegant.  Nicely handled.</td>', 'Classic glass skyscrapers and reflected sky, but done so very well.  The transition is almost seamless, which heightens the illusion.  The composition is simple and elegant.  Nicely handled.', '2017-09-12 15:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534678, 1205021, 173844, '<td valign="top">Rather busy, but I like the encompassing lushness.  The leaf blades at the edge of the shore make an interesting symmetry.  The ducks, handsomely detailed, ply this beauty with nonchalance.  A treat for the eye.</td>', 'Rather busy, but I like the encompassing lushness.  The leaf blades at the edge of the shore make an interesting symmetry.  The ducks, handsomely detailed, ply this beauty with nonchalance.  A treat for the eye.', '2017-09-12 15:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534679, 1205161, 173844, '<td valign="top">Compelling portrait.  The baby has a wonderful intensity.  The side lighting brings so much drama into the image. Great shot.</td>', 'Compelling portrait.  The baby has a wonderful intensity.  The side lighting brings so much drama into the image. Great shot.', '2017-09-12 15:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534680, 1205167, 173844, '<td valign="top">A transient reflection that''s been found, lassoed and memorialized by the photographer.  Gritty and beautiful, fine perspective and composition.  Great title.</td>', 'A transient reflection that''s been found, lassoed and memorialized by the photographer.  Gritty and beautiful, fine perspective and composition.  Great title.', '2017-09-12 15:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534681, 1205151, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful great blue heron and its reflection.  Luscious colors and bokeh.  Serene and intimate.  Handsome image.</td>', 'Beautiful great blue heron and its reflection.  Luscious colors and bokeh.  Serene and intimate.  Handsome image.', '2017-09-12 15:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534682, 1205015, 173844, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene beautifully photographed.</td>', 'A beautiful scene beautifully photographed.', '2017-09-12 16:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534684, 1205142, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflection, complex and dreamy.  I like the grain of the buildings and sidewalk.</td>', 'Very nice reflection, complex and dreamy.  I like the grain of the buildings and sidewalk.', '2017-09-12 16:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534686, 1205138, 173844, '<td valign="top">Cheery and homey.  Has the feel of a Thomas Kinkade painting.  The bridge is well served by the wide angle lens.</td>', 'Cheery and homey.  Has the feel of a Thomas Kinkade painting.  The bridge is well served by the wide angle lens.', '2017-09-12 16:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534687, 1205160, 173844, '<td valign="top">Looks like an enhaloed saint making an appearance at a seance.  Spooky and mysterious, provocative and moving.</td>', 'Looks like an enhaloed saint making an appearance at a seance.  Spooky and mysterious, provocative and moving.', '2017-09-12 16:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534688, 1204730, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great combination of clarity and blurred background.</td>', 'Great combination of clarity and blurred background.', '2017-09-12 16:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534690, 1205183, 61396, '<td valign="top">poor ducky</td>', 'poor ducky', '2017-09-12 16:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534691, 1205006, 173844, '<td valign="top">Understandable title, since the reflection is only imperceptibly different from the actual scene, but this tiny difference makes all the difference in creating that new world.  It''s become a fascinating painting.</td>', 'Understandable title, since the reflection is only imperceptibly different from the actual scene, but this tiny difference makes all the difference in creating that new world.  It''s become a fascinating painting.', '2017-09-12 16:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534692, 1205160, 61396, '<td valign="top">what a nice surprise</td>', 'what a nice surprise', '2017-09-12 16:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534693, 1205047, 61396, '<td valign="top">but above expectations. thank you.</td>', 'but above expectations. thank you.', '2017-09-12 16:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534694, 1205190, 61396, '<td valign="top">well posed</td>', 'well posed', '2017-09-12 16:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534695, 1205047, 173844, '<td valign="top">Amorphous and tangential, this could be a scene from a horror movie.  It''s certainly making me anxious.  But that engagement is what makes this a successful image.</td>', 'Amorphous and tangential, this could be a scene from a horror movie.  It''s certainly making me anxious.  But that engagement is what makes this a successful image.', '2017-09-12 16:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534696, 1205174, 173844, '<td valign="top">Most unusual reflection by far.  Thanks for this fascinating image.</td>', 'Most unusual reflection by far.  Thanks for this fascinating image.', '2017-09-12 16:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534697, 1205181, 61396, '<td valign="top">you should get going then! <br/> <br/>what''s not to like in a noisy texture? I feel I could understand it better by touching it.</td>', 'you should get going then!  what''s not to like in a noisy texture? I feel I could understand it better by touching it.', '2017-09-12 16:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534698, 1204827, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection and a great background.</td>', 'Nice reflection and a great background.', '2017-09-12 16:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534700, 1205165, 61396, '<td valign="top">nicely done multiple ways</td>', 'nicely done multiple ways', '2017-09-12 16:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534701, 1205010, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully photographed lily and an interesting shimmering reflection.  The lily pads enhance the beauty of the flower.</td>', 'Beautifully photographed lily and an interesting shimmering reflection.  The lily pads enhance the beauty of the flower.', '2017-09-12 16:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534702, 1205149, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful procession.  I like the processing, especially the green of the water.  The strong vignette serves this image well.  Very nice image.</td>', 'Wonderful procession.  I like the processing, especially the green of the water.  The strong vignette serves this image well.  Very nice image.', '2017-09-12 16:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534703, 1204592, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shimmery reflection.</td>', 'Beautiful shimmery reflection.', '2017-09-12 16:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534704, 1204809, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very pretty scene.</td>', 'Very pretty scene.', '2017-09-12 16:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534705, 1205183, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and 90 degree perspective.  Lovely olive greens.  The very partial duck emerging from the bottom a wonderful touch.  Different, creative and enjoyable.</td>', 'Interesting composition and 90 degree perspective.  Lovely olive greens.  The very partial duck emerging from the bottom a wonderful touch.  Different, creative and enjoyable.', '2017-09-12 16:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
