(7534728, 1204976, 115814, '<td valign="top">Back to bump the score. The reflection creates seamless form in the clouds. The buildings provide just enough context and tension. Wonderful!</td>', 'Back to bump the score. The reflection creates seamless form in the clouds. The buildings provide just enough context and tension. Wonderful!', '2017-09-12 19:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
