(7534738, 1205140, 114285, '<td valign="top">Ha too funny!  I love the lighting also, this must be an Aussie. I think a tighter crop to focus on the reflection would''ve been a lot more enhancing, as the other light globes are a distraction IMHO. 6 , would''ve been higher if you cropped it ;)</td>', 'Ha too funny!  I love the lighting also, this must be an Aussie. I think a tighter crop to focus on the reflection would''ve been a lot more enhancing, as the other light globes are a distraction IMHO. 6 , would''ve been higher if you cropped it ;)', '2017-09-12 21:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
