(7534905, 1205189, 77196, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by streetpigeon:</b></div><hr/><i> In your face, as those of great wealth often are, yet lovingly detailed with a tracery of trees.  I like the juxtaposition and the crispness of lines and details.  Classy, aside from being a Royce. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>The car is an early 1930''s Auburn 851. Not quite as exclusive as a Royce, but still quite a bit higher status than a "poor man''s car". This was shot at Eckert Park in Auburn, Indiana at the 2017 Auburn Cord Duesenberg festival. ACD ceased producing cars in 1937, so this car is at least 80 years old.<br/>Thanks for your comment and vote!</td>', 'Originally posted by streetpigeon: In your face, as those of great wealth often are, yet lovingly detailed with a tracery of trees.  I like the juxtaposition and the crispness of lines and details.  Classy, aside from being a Royce.  The car is an early 1930''s Auburn 851. Not quite as exclusive as a Royce, but still quite a bit higher status than a "poor man''s car". This was shot at Eckert Park in Auburn, Indiana at the 2017 Auburn Cord Duesenberg festival. ACD ceased producing cars in 1937, so this car is at least 80 years old.Thanks for your comment and vote!', '2017-09-13 10:48:05.000000', NULL, 0),
