(7534952, 1205138, 37719, '<td valign="top">Looks like my neck of the woods...Bridge of Flowers.  Very nice shot.  I very much like the lighting front to back/top to bottom.  Well done. Right around the corner is where I took this image:  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=772551" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1005/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_772551.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1005/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_772551.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1005/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_772551.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Did you get any nice shots from <a href="https://www.tripsavvy.com/new-englands-coolest-potholes-3858809" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here?</a>  There is also a great glass blowing shop which offers some unique opportunities for pictures.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-09-13 19:40:18.</i></td>', 'Looks like my neck of the woods...Bridge of Flowers.  Very nice shot.  I very much like the lighting front to back/top to bottom.  Well done. Right around the corner is where I took this image:    Did you get any nice shots from here?  There is also a great glass blowing shop which offers some unique opportunities for pictures.', '2017-09-13 20:13:38.000000', '2017-09-13 20:40:18.000000', 0),
